$ontext

   CAPRI project

   GAMS file : SMAL_PSHAR.GMS

   @purpose  : Defines small producer shares
               Updated May 2008, P Witzke.
               This information was received from Piere Bascou from DG-Agri in july 2002 and updated from AG situation reports
               original file in r:\capsim\xls\policy_variables\raw_policy_dat\act_pol_expost.xls
               Small producer shares were projected as share-hat = exp(a+b*year) to force them positive after 2004 or 2005 (depending on SFP introduction).
               Shares for EL, NL, FI, SE, SI, MT were projected as average of last two years available to avoid increasing trends.

   @module   : premiums

   @author   : W.Britz, H.P. Witzke
   @date     : 22.02.11
   @since    : Spring 2005
   @refDoc   :
   @seeAlso  :
   @calledBy :

$offtext
